      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Control of Supplies (Amendment) Act 2014."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette. Amendment of section 6"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Control of Supplies Act 1961 [Act 122], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended by substituting for paragraph 6(2)(k) the following paragraph: “(k) limiting the quantity of any controlled article which may be acquired or held by any person or class of persons including providing for the registration of the person or class of persons, the issuance of user cards by the Controller or any person authorized by the Controller, and the imposition of conditions, fees or charges in respect of the issuance of the user cards;”. Amendment of section 20"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@/~cl_3__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 20 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (4), by substituting for the words “or other person authorized by the said subsection to carry out the search and” the words “, the supplies officer or the police officer not below the rank of Inspector and”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@/~cl_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (4) the following subsection: “(5) Any vehicle, vessel or other article, by means of which an offence has been committed under this section or which is intended to be used for the commission of the offence, may be removed by the Controller, the supplies officer or the police officer not below the rank of Inspector and, if not claimed within one month of the removal, may be sold or disposed of by the Controller as he thinks fit, and the proceeds of such sale, if any, shall be paid into the Consolidated Fund.”. Amendment of section 22"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@/~cl_4__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@/~cl_4__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 22 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@/~cl_4__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
